# lights v1.0.0

## Forms

### `(anchor …)`

A named point a spot light can aim at.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:name` | `symbol` | yes | — | — |

### `(light …)`

One light. `:kind` selects the variant, and defaults to `point`.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:kind` | `symbol enum` | no | `point` | one of: `point`, `spot`, `sun`<br>Omitted, this reads as `point` and selects that variant. |
| `:intensity` | `number` | no | `1` | — |

#### Variant `:kind point`

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:range` | `number` | no | `10` | Falloff radius. Materialized whenever the light is a point light, written or defaulted. |

#### Variant `:kind spot`

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:reach` | `number` | no | `20` | — |
| `:angle` | `number` | no | `45` | — |
| `:aim` | `ref → (anchor :name …)` | no | `origin` | Where the cone points. The default is a name, and a defaulted name is checked. |

#### Variant `:kind sun`

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:direction` | `vector<any>` | yes | — | No default: a sun with no direction is `missing_required_key`. |

## Value kinds

### light-kind

The three light shapes.

Type: `symbol enum` — one of: `point`, `spot`, `sun`.

### anchor-name

Cross-ref to an `(anchor :name …)` the document declares.

Type: `ref → (anchor :name …)`.
